0014-usb-qmi-wwan-Add-QMI-support-for-EG25.patch
0015-usb-cdc-mbim-Add-MBIM-support-for-EG25.patch
0016-usb-net-qmi-wwan-Add-QMI-WWAN-for-modem.patch

